  record:
    id: FMA31748
    name: lower lobe part of left bronchial tree
    object_name: A_FMA31748
    system: Respiratory
    tissue: airway
    source_kind: source_mesh_with_authored_lumen
    source_record: source/source-manifest.json
    required_group: lobar_bronchial_trees
    notes: 'BodyParts3D 4.0 original spatial assembly; production copy welded, degenerate/duplicate
      faces removed, UV mapped and optimized. Source was a solid cast of uncertain
      luminal/external boundary. Authored inward wall offset 0.65 mm; source endpoint
      terminations retained. Inner shell is an explicit teaching approximation, not
      segmented tissue thickness. Lumen sample validation finding: cutting disabled
      until resolved. Initial offset failed lumen samples; replaced with 0.1 mm authored
      teaching wall. See qa/reports/lumen-wall-adjustments.json. Lumen sample validation
